AGENTS.md --- Text
1 # UAC spike
2 
3 Scope: local Rust + TypeScript simulator. No deployment, real wallet, vehicle, or user credential import. Eight-hour foreground budget. Respect other edits.
4 
5 Oracle: `just check` and `just e2e`; browser tests use isolated virtual CTAP2 authenticators and the real Rust WebAuthn verifier. Label hardware verification as deferred.
6 
7 Structure: deployables in apps/, shared Rust in crates/, helpers in scripts/, evidence in docs/evidence/. Reuse reviewed crypto and WebAuthn libraries. No custom signing primitives. No secrets in logs.
8 

